# SenseTalk Diagnostic & Visualization Tool

## Overview
This tool provides an interactive diagnostic and visualization environment using SenseTalk. It simulates a system health check, generates diagnostic reports, and provides simple text-based visualizations of system status.

## Features
- Simulated hardware and software component checks
- Interactive menu-driven interface
- Text-based visualization of system status
- Diagnostic report generation
- Data processing and analysis utilities

## Usage
1. Run the script with an appropriate SenseTalk interpreter
2. Follow the on-screen menu to select diagnostics or visualization options
3. View results and generated reports

## Code Structure
- `main.st` - Entry point and main program logic
- Functions for diagnostics, visualization, and data processing
- Sample data sets for demonstration purposes
